-- the world and tell both factions' sides fairly. Validated by tests/harness.lua:
--   * the answer appears exactly once among the choices, distractors are distinct
--   * literal (Initiate) answers really appear in their passage
--   * vocabulary words appear in their passage, word tiles rebuild the sentence
--   * every written-answer model answer passes its own keyword rubric
-- lv = difficulty 1..3 (generator level 1-2 -> 1, 3 -> 2, 4-5 -> 3).
